commit 735c40bff7270cc4d2a88f663ba4b663986b468c ("imac: seal tracked frame-regression crumbs", 2026-10-28), blobs
1cbe79cb1903968bec89b1b3b9b1f4d6477f6897 (sky_real.c) and 1c0f7147442337b5a8045f9c9457a5a5d620b64c (night.c).
That commit is on aienux side branches (feat/imac-*, fix/imac-*), not on the aienux main that was folded into
kernel/, so it is not in this repository. scripts/ck_sky_sharpness_test.sh takes its historical cubic lobes and
